<!-- Interface icons.

     Material Design Icons by Pictogrammers, Apache 2.0. The path data is embedded
     rather than fetched, so the interface draws identically offline and does not
     depend on a service staying up.

     These replace the emoji the toolbar used to carry. Emoji are drawn by whichever
     font the operating system picks, so the same button was a flat outline on one
     machine and a full-colour cartoon hand on another — and the emergency stop, of
     all controls, must look the same everywhere.

     Every icon is 24 by 24. Colour comes from the control, so they follow the theme. -->
